{"version":1,"key":"card:732","content":{"id":732,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"srcset","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<img>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素上用于响应式图片加载的属性。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目前存在很多种设备，PC、移动端，不同设备之间的分辨率和屏幕尺寸也各不相同。如果所有场景都使用同一张图片，可能会造成带宽浪费和加载速度下降，比如在低分辨率设备上加载高清大图，或在小屏手机上下载桌面端尺寸的图片，都是不必要的浪费。因此需要一种能根据设备分辨率和屏幕大小自动选择合适图片源的机制，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"srcset","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是用来解决这个问题的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它的语法是："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<img srcset=\"url1 描述符1, url2 描述符2, ... \" sizes=\"\" src=\"fallback url\" />","language":"HTML","uuid":"b27e50aa-26cc-40b7-a752-2d6be21a4f02","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中描述符有两种，且在同一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"srcset","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中不能混用："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"按照设备像素比(DPR) 选择，适用于固定尺寸场景，单位是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"x","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<img \n  src=\"icon.png\" \n  srcset=\"icon-2x.png 2x, icon-3x.png 3x\" \n  alt=\"图标\"\n>","language":"HTML","uuid":"0036323c-ff4b-437a-844e-de7539d68734","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"x","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 描述符时，浏览器会根据当前设备的 DPR 自动匹配对应的图片源。大多数现代移动设备的 DPR 都在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"2x","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以上（如 iPhone 14 Pro 已达到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"3x","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"），所以一般至少需要提供 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"2x","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的图片"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不写描述符，就默认是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1x","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，一般情况下会放到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"src","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中作为回退"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"按照图片宽度选择，适用于响应式布局场景，单位是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 描述符表示图片文件自身的固有宽度（intrinsic width），以像素为单位。浏览器在选择图片时，会先根据 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":658,"contentId":4961,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sizes"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 确定图片的预期显示宽度（CSS 像素），再乘以设备的 DPR 得到实际需要的像素数，然后在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"srcset","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 候选列表中选择最合适的图片源"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","code":"<img \n  srcset=\"\n    photo-320w.jpg   320w,\n    photo-768w.jpg   768w,\n    photo-1200w.jpg 1200w,\n    photo-1920w.jpg 1920w\n  \"\n  sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 33vw\"\n  src=\"photo-768w.jpg\"\n  alt=\"照片\"\n>","uuid":"f8c4e64e-3611-4eef-b6ed-590be2819ddf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设当前设备的 DPR 为 2，屏幕宽度为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"375px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。根据 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sizes","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的定义，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"375px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命中了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"max-width: 600px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么预期图片的显示宽度就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"100vw","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"375px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"（CSS 像素），乘以 DPR 得到实际需要的像素数为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"375 × 2 = 750","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在候选列表中 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"768w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是最接近且满足需求的，因此浏览器会选择 photo-768w.jpg 这张图片源"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["HTML/srcset"],"createTime":1779236592375,"updateTime":1779238862102,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1779238862102},"links":{"card:658":{"key":"card:658","type":"card","id":658}}}